---
// Base text to be legally reviewed by the client (company name and tax number missing).
import LegalPage from '../../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site';
---

<LegalPage lang="en" route="privacy" title="Privacy policy" updated="Last updated: 1 October 2026">
  <p><em>This is a translation for convenience. The Portuguese version prevails.</em></p>

  <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>{SITE.name}</strong>, with offices at {`${SITE.address.street}, ${SITE.postalLine}`}, Portugal, is the controller of the personal data collected through this website and in the
    course of its accounting, tax, payroll and advisory services. Contact:
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email.address}`}>{SITE.email.address}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Data we process</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Identification and contact details you send us voluntarily by email, phone or WhatsApp.</li>
    <li>Tax, accounting and employment data needed to perform our service agreement.</li>
    <li>Technical request data (IP address, date and time, browser type) logged by our hosting provider for security and operation.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Purposes and legal basis</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Performance of a contract</strong>: providing the services you engage us for (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR).</li>
    <li><strong>Legal obligations</strong>: filings with the Tax Authority, Social Security and other public bodies (Art. 6(1)(c) GDPR).</li>
    <li><strong>Legitimate interest</strong>: answering enquiries, managing client relationships and website security (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Retention</h2>
  <p>
    Tax and accounting records are kept for the periods required by Portuguese tax and commercial law (generally 10
    years). Contact data with no contractual relationship is deleted after 3 years without interaction.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Cookies and local storage</h2>
  <p>
    This website uses no tracking, advertising or analytics cookies. Fonts are served by the site itself, with no
    third-party requests. We only store in your browser (<em>localStorage</em>) the fact that you dismissed the cookie
    notice.
  </p>
  <p>
    The Google map only loads if you click “Show map”. From then on, Google may collect data and set cookies under its
    own privacy policy.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Processors and international transfers</h2>
  <p>
    The website is hosted by Vercel Inc. This service, like Google (if you enable the map) and Meta (if you contact us
    on WhatsApp), may involve transfers outside the European Union under the EU-US Data Privacy Framework or standard
    contractual clauses approved by the European Commission. For our services we use accounting software and cloud
    storage bound by processing agreements under Art. 28 GDPR.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You may at any time exercise your rights of access, rectification, erasure, restriction, portability and objection
    by emailing us. You may also lodge a complaint with the Portuguese data protection authority, CNPD
    (<a href="https://www.cnpd.pt" target="_blank" rel="noopener">cnpd.pt</a>).
  </p>

  <h2>8. Security</h2>
  <p>
    We apply appropriate technical and organisational measures, such as access control, encryption in transit and
    regular backups, to protect your data against unauthorised access, alteration or destruction.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Changes</h2>
  <p>This policy may be updated to reflect legal or operational changes. The version published on this page is always the one in force.</p>
</LegalPage>
